<title>AUSTRIA: OMV prelim 96 earnings, dividend up.</title>
<headline>OMV prelim 96 earnings, dividend up.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results for the year ending December 31, 1996. Pre-tax earnings were at a record high for the second straight year.</p>
<p>(Figures in billions of schillings unless stated)</p>
<p>						     1996	   1995</p>
<p>    Group EBIT				    2.9   vs    2.19</p>
<p>(earnings before interest and tax)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax				 2.9   vs    2.09</p>
<p>    Group net				     1.9   vs    1.73</p>
<p>    Dividend (schillings)			23   vs	20</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is OMV AG. It is an oil and chemicals group and is Austria's biggest industrial concern. -- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
</text>
